✔ world documents mount on first visible tab, preserve mounted frames and do not eagerly create all history iframes (46.301453ms)
✔ native regex cards expand without the moon-tide scroll or paging shell and retain their own documents (34.501458ms)
✔ unused legacy annotations are explained in More while independent public memory remains readable (39.683967ms)
✔ bad capture numbers and lookaround captures cannot insert hidden source context into a public panel; failures are cached (2.706689ms)
