✔ native-hosted content counts as present and actions sit after original panel above message toolbar (38.142315ms)
✔ far history is deferred before parsing and mounts when approaching the viewport (57.18395ms)
✔ bounded derived cache snapshot restores exact keys without overwriting newly computed values (0.801927ms)
✔ offscreen deferral settles its MutationObserver and yields to input timers (88.201238ms)
✔ helper source identity is captured before slow cache preparation and survives replacement before first paint (68.339563ms)
✔ a claimed helper container remains identifiable while its iframe is pending or temporarily suspended (5.066945ms)
✔ the world orb expands the original helper panel directly without a waiting notice or a second runtime (67.384904ms)
✔ native content replacement is scheduled once, preserves folds, and cannot resurrect after disposal (150.615858ms)
✔ mixed regex output preserves static parts while only script documents belong to the helper (3.792244ms)
✔ original paragraph, indent, dialogue and punctuation rules reach sanitized host prose (59.518475ms)
✔ multiline and nested marks are built before Markdown separates their boundaries (19.740925ms)
✔ authored cards, code and link targets survive formatting without inner decoration (8.501276ms)
✔ unavailable references remain labels, invalid mark boundaries stop explicitly (10.021732ms)
✔ message and reader both mount original prose styles and keep private blocks outside formatter (201.884313ms)
